<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Home Assistant 贡献者 blog: Apps</title><description>News for contributors to Apps.</description><link>https://www.hasscn.top/</link><item><title>多播插件即将弃用</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/17/multicast-plugin-deprecation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/17/multicast-plugin-deprecation/</guid><description>Supervisor 正在逐步淘汰多播插件。本文概述了这一变更、受影响的应用程序以及如何进行测试。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item><item><title>应用将失去四个默认的 Linux 能力</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/06/apps-fewer-default-capabilities/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/11/06/apps-fewer-default-capabilities/</guid><description>Supervisor 正在为应用容器采用更小的默认能力集。本文概述了此变更、受影响的应用以及如何测试。</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item><item><title>将应用构建迁移到 Docker BuildKit</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/04/02/builder-migration/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2026/04/02/builder-migration/</guid><description>旧版 home-assistant/builder 容器和旧的 home-assistant/builder GitHub Action 已停用。</description><pubDate>Thu, 02 Apr 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item><item><title>自 OS 16 起加载项中打开文件限制的处理</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2025/07/14/home-assistant-os-16-open-file-limit/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2025/07/14/home-assistant-os-16-open-file-limit/</guid><description>随着 Home Assistant OS 16 的发布，Docker 容器中打开文件描述符的默认限制（相应地，也影响到所有加载项（add-on）及其内部的进程）发生了变化。</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Jul 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category><category>os</category></item><item><title>加载项公开配置</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2023/11/06/public-addon-config/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2023/11/06/public-addon-config/</guid><description>加载项（add-on）现在可以拥有一个用于配置或数据文件的公开文件夹，用户可以查看和修改其中的内容，同时它仍会随加载项一起备份。</description><pubDate>Mon, 06 Nov 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item><item><title>Supervisor 加载项的新限制</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2023/04/13/new_limits_for_add_ons/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2023/04/13/new_limits_for_add_ons/</guid><description>随着 Home Assistant OS 10 的发布，我们更新到了最新的 Docker 23.0 版本。在新的 Docker 版本中，加载项（add-ons）可打开的文件描述符最大数量变为了无限（某种意义上）。</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Apr 2023 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item><item><title>我们 Docker 基础镜像的 S6-Overlay 3.x 更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2022/05/12/s6-overlay-base-images/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2022/05/12/s6-overlay-base-images/</guid><description>我们已开始更新我们的基础镜像，以使用新的 s6-Overlay v3。一篇迁移文章也解释了此次变化带来的新可能性。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 May 2022 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item><item><title>Supervisor 更新</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2021/08/24/supervisor_update/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2021/08/24/supervisor_update/</guid><description>距离我们上一次发布关于 Supervisor 变更的文章已经有一段时间了。以下是过去一年以及未来的一些亮点。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Aug 2021 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item><item><title>加载项即将迎来的变更</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/10/29/supervisor-update/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/10/29/supervisor-update/</guid><description>你现在可以将我们的 [builder][marketplace] 用作 [GitHub action][github_action] 了！:tada:</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item><item><title>用于我们 Docker 容器的 S6 Overlay</title><link>https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/04/12/s6-overlay/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hasscn.top/contributors/blog/2020/04/12/s6-overlay/</guid><description>Home Assistant 出于各种用途使用了许多不同的 Docker 容器。</description><pubDate>Sun, 12 Apr 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>apps</category></item></channel></rss>